  "research": {
    "presetId": "world_of_warcraft",
    "revision": "2026-09-14.1",
    "category": "PC / console",
    "summary": "Adventure and trade fund stronger gear, collections and continued access.",
    "scope": "Retail, Midnight Season 2. Broad PvE gearing, professions, gold and Token loop; Classic, PvP currencies and class systems excluded.",
    "checkedAt": "2026-09-14",
    "limitations": [
      "Midnight Season 2 gearing is corroborated with Icy Veins, updated August 2026. Upgrade currency is Mistcrests, not the older Valorstones. Track restrictions are retained; exact costs omitted.",
      "Player-to-player gold transfers are not new system gold. Materials and tradable crafted items are alternatives, not a claim that all equipment is tradable.",
      "Token rules differ by region and account eligibility. Gold-purchased Tokens cannot be resold, and Battle.net balance is not withdrawable cash.",
      "Qualitative resource flows, not a balance simulation. Prices, odds and reward quantities are intentionally omitted. Sources were reviewed on the checked date; this is desk research, not a claim of live playtesting."
    ],
